To implement the background color customization feature, I will:

1.  **Update `index.html`**: Modify the CSS to use CSS variables (`--app-bg`, `--app-text-contrast`) for the body's background and color, enabling dynamic switching.
2.  **Update `constants.ts`**: Define the color palette array with hex codes and corresponding text contrast colors.
3.  **Update `App.tsx`**: Manage the background color state here (similar to Dark Mode), persist it to `localStorage`, and apply the CSS variables to the document root.
4.  **Update `components/Sidebar.tsx`**: Add the visual interface (color circles) for the user to select the background color.

